  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"78f9f69c-fb93-4e61-847e-b1c74a18aab5\">\n  <figure>\n    <img src=\"/images/articles/78f9f69c-fb93-4e61-847e-b1c74a18aab5-1.png\" alt=\"Sheet music and lyrics for Love is Like a Breath of Heaven\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>This song has a simple melody, but one person described it as “the most scriptural song I ever heard.” It is a song worthy to add to your collection.</p>\n\n  <p>Since I only heard the melody and never had notes or harmony, this music may not match the “official” music, if there is any out there. If anyone knows who the author is, or if any music has been published with this song, please contact me. <em>-Mike Atnip</em></p>\n</article>\n",
